# Library Context7 Pack

Use skill `library-context7-pack` when `sdk_api_context` or `context7_required`
is true.

## Required behavior

1. `resolve-library-id` with version pin when repo version contracts exist.
2. One markdown shard per topic cluster under `sdk-context/context7/<entry>/`.
3. Context7 is the **primary** OpenAPI/Swagger interpretive layer; optional fetch mirror for offline JSON only.
4. Pair with `firecrawl-context7-crosscheck` when vendor docs are also in scope.

Shared implementation: `ai-library-entry/references/shared/context7_entry.mjs`
